This repository is derived from the relink branch of Popax21/synaTudor and
subsequent work in rstar000/synaTudor. The original Git history is retained so
individual authorship remains visible. Local build caches, machine-specific
paths, diagnostic residue, and deterministic USB-replay crypto were removed
from that history before publication.

The cryptbridge subproject contains code derived from Wine and includes work
copyrighted by Wine and CodeWeavers contributors. Its original copyright and
license headers are retained in the source files.

The source is distributed under the terms in LICENSE and the notices in each
file. Some files explicitly permit GNU LGPL version 2.1 or any later version.

Synaptics and Lenovo binaries are not part of this repository. A local build
downloads Lenovo's driver package from Lenovo and extracts two DLLs without
executing the installer. Those binaries remain subject to their vendor's
terms. Synaptics and Lenovo are trademarks of their respective owners; this
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by either company.
